   "lines": [
    "Oyster Bay, Long Island.",
    "The family came out",
    "of town yesterday, with",
    "Uncle Jimmie &",
    "Aunt Annie, to spend",
    "New Years with us.",
    "We had a very jolly",
    "time. They left in",
    "the afternoon, when",
    "Jack ^Elliott^ & I took a",
    "brisk tramp through",
    "the snow covered",
    "woods with our guns."
   ],
